# OboxSTEAM Mobile — Project Context

> Load when working on Parent features, auth, routing, or API wiring. Engineering: `expo-engineering-rule.mdc`. UI: `styling-rule.mdc`. Endpoints: `parent-api.mdc`.

---

## What this repo is

**OboxSTEAM.Mobile** — separate Expo (React Native) app for the **Parent** MVP. Same backend as `OboxSTEAM.FE` (`EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL`). Web FE stays on VPS; this app is Android-first (Expo Go / EAS APK).

**Out of scope (v1):** Manager screens, portfolio microsites, mentor flows, inventing new backend endpoints, shared npm packages with FE.

---

## Actors (mobile focus)

| Actor | Mobile treatment |
|-------|------------------|
| **Parent** | Only supported role after `GET /api/account/me` |
| Other roles | Show “use website” + logout — do not build Student/Manager UI |

**Parent–Child linking:** Parent sees linked children via `GET /api/parent/links`. Link/approve/magic-login/complete-profile flows mirror FE Parent dialogs as RN screens.

---

## Product domain (short)

OboxSTEAM is a Vietnamese STEAM learning platform. Parents register/link children, pay when requested, and monitor progress/notifications. Portfolio, LMS detail, and mentor tools live on the **web FE** — mobile only surfaces Parent-needed APIs.

---

## Routing (Expo Router)

```text
app/
├── (auth)/
│   └── login.tsx                 → email/password
├── (app)/                        → tabs after auth (Parent only)
│   ├── _layout.tsx
│   ├── index.tsx                 → children list (getParentLinks)
│   ├── notifications.tsx
│   ├── profile.tsx               → profile + logout
│   └── children/[id].tsx         → phase 1b when APIs exist
└── _layout.tsx
```

Deep links (phase 1b): magic-login, approve-link, parent checkout → `expo-linking` / `Linking.openURL(checkoutUrl)`.

---

## Tech stack

| Layer | Choice |
|-------|--------|
| App | Expo SDK + Expo Router |
| Language | TypeScript (strict) |
| Styling | NativeWind v4 + brand tokens in `tailwind.config.js` / `src/lib/tokens` |
| Forms | Zod + react-hook-form |
| Auth storage | `expo-secure-store` (not sessionStorage) |
| State | React context first; no Redux unless needed later |
| Icons | `lucide-react-native` |
| Package manager | **pnpm only** |
| Realtime (1b) | `@microsoft/signalr` + `/hubs/notifications` |

---

## Key conventions

- Alias `@/` → `src/` (FE modules re-copied under `src/lib/...`).
- Do **not** copy FE `components/ui` (shadcn/DOM) — rebuild with `View` / `Text` / `Pressable`.
- API/validation/errors: **copy + adapt** from FE; see `SYNC.md` when contracts change.
- Gate on Parent role after `getCurrentUser`.
- Vietnamese copy aligned with FE Parent strings where possible.
- Student/parent PII: never log tokens or personal data.

